#### '*' still matches across a multi-byte character (regression guard, not a bug fix -- byte-stepping already found the same answer here, just wastefully)

- Verify: '*' still matches across a multi-byte character (regression guard, not a bug fix -- byte-stepping already found the same answer here, just wastefully)


<details>
<summary>Executable SSpec</summary>

Runnable source: 4 lines folded for reproduction.
